usage: emit_rup_certificate.py [-h] [--module MODULE]
                               [--normalized-json NORMALIZED_JSON]
                               certificate output

Validate a PHP(5,4) RUP certificate and emit a kernel-checkable Lean module.

positional arguments:
  certificate
  output

options:
